<?xml version='1.0' standalone='yes'?>
<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN>

<PLUGIN name="Glacier-Theme"
        author="R0m1k3"
        version="2026.10.26.1947"
        launch="Settings/GlacierThemeSettings"
        pluginURL="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/R0m1k3/Glacier-Theme/main/Glacier-Theme.plg"
        support="https://github.com/R0m1k3/Glacier-Theme/issues"
        icon="paint-brush"
        min="7.2.0">

<CHANGES>
###2026.10.26.1947
- Busy dialogs: Unraid's three green falling dots become a small comet in the accent colour (light and dark), circling over the faded confirm button.

###2026.10.26.1934
- Login and first-time password pages in Glacier's style (light or dark, accent colour): a rounded card with the Unraid wordmark on a dark header, rounded fields, a full-width login button, errors and the logged-out note as coloured boxes. The install adds one guarded include line to Unraid's two login pages; removing the plugin takes it out again. ?glacier=off works there too.

###2026.10.26.1928
- The header is a dark card across the page: logo and version on the left, date and time in the middle, licence, server, notifications and menu on the right.

###2026.10.26.1923
- More room inside the Unraid card, above the logo and under the version.

###2026.10.26.1913
- Wide screens: the quick actions move into a card in the sidebar, under the menu card, as small round buttons five to a row with the array usage bar above them.
- Larger Unraid card (logo and version) aligned with the sidebar; page headings on a card; 24px between cards and deeper drop shadows, in light and dark.
- The server name, notifications and menu at the top right now end at the right edge of the page content and centre on the logo card.
- The sidebar stays in view while scrolling when the window is tall enough to show all of it.

###2026.10.26.1709
- Page enhancements adapted from Aurora Theme (MIT, see NOTICE.md), in French and English:
- Page headings on every tab. Dashboard: key figures strip, processor cores as tiles, charts and rings in theme colours, fan and VM-usage cards, an update badge on container icons, and a container dialog with all actions.
- Settings and Tools: search ("/" to focus) and favourites with a star. Users: cards with initials, roles, search and Add user.
- Main: Array Operation as cards, with parity-check progress and danger buttons.
- Docker: summary, filters, search, Basic/Advanced, compact view with WebUI, CPU, memory and actions, phone cards; port check in the container editor.
- Application groups for Docker and VMs (also on the Dashboard), VM details and snapshot buttons. Off when FolderView is installed.

###2026.10.26.1607
- Dark mode: follows the Dynamix theme (White light, Black dark), or always light / always dark (new setting).
- Theme version on the settings page and in the footer.
- Logo and version in a dark card above the menu card.
- Plugins page: title and description laid out, support link as a pill, icon in a tinted squircle.
- Docker page: icon and name side by side, folded ports and volume paths no longer cut mid-line, wide tables scroll instead of being clipped.
- Apps (Community Applications): the category menu as a list with the selected entry highlighted, rounded app cards.
- Paragraphs and table cells left-aligned instead of justified.

###2026.10.26.1550
- Wide screens: the main menu in a card on the left with an icon per entry, the quick actions centred under the header. Tablets: the menu bar on its own row.
- Badges: container and VM states, update and check status (Docker, Plugins), disk temperatures (warm or red past the Disk Settings thresholds), file systems, licence type.
- Waiting updates: counters on the Docker and Plugins menu entries and on the Dashboard card; Plugins Update button, new version and Docker "apply update" stand out.
- Header: the server name shows properly when the server has no description.

###2026.10.26.1530
- First release: Glacier light theme over Dynamix White. Plus Jakarta Sans, pill navigation, content cards, Dashboard tiles as cards with a greeting card, rounded tables, inputs, switches, buttons, dialogs and footer. Accent colour setting.
</CHANGES>

<!-- Install: write all plugin files. Generated by plugin/build.py; edit the sources, not this file. -->
<FILE Run="/bin/bash">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
rm -rf /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme
mkdir -p /boot/config/plugins/Glacier-Theme /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/fonts /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/include /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/scripts /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/styles
cat > /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/GlacierTheme.page <<'GLACIER_THEME_EOF'
Menu="Buttons"
Link="nav-user"
Title="Glacier Theme"
---
<?php
// Unraid evaluates every "Buttons" page inside <head> on each page, after its own stylesheets,
// so this is where the theme attaches its files. Link="nav-user" keeps it from adding a button.
$glacier = parse_plugin_cfg('Glacier-Theme');
$glacierCustomDir = '/boot/config/plugins/Glacier-Theme';
$glacierVersion = '2026.10.26.1947';

// Emergency switch: any page opened with ?glacier=off stops the theme in this browser
// (remembered in a cookie) until a page is opened with ?glacier=on.
$glacierSwitch = $_GET['glacier'] ?? '';
$glacierOff = $glacierSwitch == 'off' || ($glacierSwitch != 'on' && !empty($_COOKIE['glacier_off']));
if (($glacier['theme'] ?? 'yes') != 'yes') $glacierOff = true;
// Glacier is drawn over the Dynamix top-menu themes, White and Black. Azure and Gray (Unraid's
// own sidebar layouts) are left alone.
$glacierDynamix = (string) ($display['theme'] ?? '');
if (!in_array($glacierDynamix, ['white', 'black'], true)) $glacierOff = true;
?>
<?php if ($glacierSwitch == 'off'): ?>
<script>document.cookie = 'glacier_off=1; path=/; max-age=31536000; SameSite=Lax';</script>
<?php elseif ($glacierSwitch == 'on'): ?>
<script>document.cookie = 'glacier_off=; path=/; max-age=0; SameSite=Lax';</script>
<?php endif; ?>
<?php if (!$glacierOff): ?>
<?php
$glacierClasses = ['glacier'];
// Light or dark: "auto" follows the Dynamix theme (White light, Black dark).
$glacierMode = (string) ($glacier['mode'] ?? 'auto');
if ($glacierMode == 'dark' || ($glacierMode != 'light' && $glacierDynamix == 'black')) $glacierClasses[] = 'gl-dark';
if (($glacier['hero'] ?? 'yes') == 'yes') $glacierClasses[] = 'gl-hero-on';
$glacierPage = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9_-]/', '', (string) ($myPage['name'] ?? ''));
if ($glacierPage !== '') $glacierClasses[] = 'gl-page-' . $glacierPage;
?>
<script>document.documentElement.classList.add(...<?= json_encode($glacierClasses) ?>);</script>
<?php // Disk temperature warning and critical thresholds (°C, Disk Settings), for the temperature badges. ?>
<script>window.glacierVersion = <?= json_encode($glacierVersion) ?>;</script>
<script>window.glacierTemp = <?= json_encode(['hot' => (int) ($display['hot'] ?? 45), 'max' => (int) ($display['max'] ?? 55)]) ?>;</script>
<?php
// Waiting updates, for the counters on the Docker and Plugins menu entries and the Dashboard card.
// A missing include would be a fatal error on every page, so it is checked first.
$glacierUpdates = null;
$glacierUpdatesLib = '/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/include/updates.php';
if (is_file($glacierUpdatesLib)) {
    try {
        require_once $glacierUpdatesLib;
        $glacierUpdates = glacier_updates();
    } catch (Throwable $glacierError) {
        $glacierUpdates = null;
    }
}
?>
<?php if ($glacierUpdates !== null): ?>
<script>window.glacierUpdates = <?= json_encode($glacierUpdates) ?>;</script>
<?php endif; ?>
<link type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" href="<?php autov('/plugins/Glacier-Theme/styles/glacier.css') ?>">
<?php
// Accent colour from the settings page ("#0f766e"). The lighter shades are mixed in CSS; here
// the text colour on accent buttons is chosen (white or near-black, whichever reads better)
// and a light tint is made for the buttons on the dark Dashboard card.
$glacierAccent = strtolower(ltrim(trim((string) ($glacier['accent'] ?? '')), '#'));
if (preg_match('/^[0-9a-f]{3}$/', $glacierAccent)) $glacierAccent = preg_replace('/(.)/', '$1$1', $glacierAccent);
if (preg_match('/^[0-9a-f]{6}$/', $glacierAccent)):
    $glacierLuminance = function ($hex) {
        $channels = [];
        foreach (str_split($hex, 2) as $pair) {
            $v = hexdec($pair) / 255;
            $channels[] = $v <= 0.03928 ? $v / 12.92 : (($v + 0.055) / 1.055) ** 2.4;
        }
        return 0.2126 * $channels[0] + 0.7152 * $channels[1] + 0.0722 * $channels[2];
    };
    $glacierL = $glacierLuminance($glacierAccent);
    $glacierOnWhite = 1.05 / ($glacierL + 0.05);
    $glacierOnInk = ($glacierL + 0.05) / ($glacierLuminance('0f172a') + 0.05);
    $glacierText = $glacierOnWhite >= $glacierOnInk ? '#ffffff' : '#0f172a';
?>
<style id="glacier-accent">
html.glacier, html.glacier.gl-dark { --gl-accent: #<?= $glacierAccent ?>; --gl-accent-text: <?= $glacierText ?>; --gl-accent-bright: color-mix(in oklab, #<?= $glacierAccent ?>, white 55%); }
</style>
<?php endif; ?>
<?php
// The page enhancements: the shared kit first, then every styles/gl-*.css and scripts/gl-*.js.
// An enhancement that needs data from the server puts it in the page from include/head-*.php.
$glacierDir = '/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme';
$glacierTitle = '';
try {
    // The page's own title ("CPU Pinning", "UPS Settings") for the page heading, made the way
    // Unraid makes its section titles.
    $glacierTitle = (string) ($myPage['Title'] ?? '');
    if ($glacierTitle !== '' && function_exists('processTitle')) $glacierTitle = processTitle($glacierTitle);
    if ($glacierTitle !== '' && function_exists('parse_text')) $glacierTitle = _(parse_text(html_entity_decode($glacierTitle)));
    $glacierTitle = trim(preg_replace('/\s+/', ' ', strip_tags($glacierTitle)));
    if (strpos($glacierTitle, '$') !== false || mb_strlen($glacierTitle) > 60) $glacierTitle = '';
} catch (Throwable $glacierError) {
    $glacierTitle = '';
}
?>
<?php if ($glacierTitle !== ''): ?>
<script>window.glacierPageTitle = <?= json_encode($glacierTitle, JSON_HEX_TAG | JSON_HEX_AMP | JSON_HEX_APOS | JSON_HEX_QUOT) ?>;</script>
<?php endif; ?>
<?php foreach (glob("$glacierDir/styles/gl-*.css") ?: [] as $glacierSheet): ?>
<link type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" href="<?php autov('/plugins/Glacier-Theme/styles/' . basename($glacierSheet)) ?>">
<?php endforeach; ?>
<script defer src="<?php autov('/plugins/Glacier-Theme/scripts/gl-core.js') ?>"></script>
<?php foreach (glob("$glacierDir/scripts/gl-*.js") ?: [] as $glacierScript): ?>
<?php if (basename($glacierScript) !== 'gl-core.js'): ?>
<script defer src="<?php autov('/plugins/Glacier-Theme/scripts/' . basename($glacierScript)) ?>"></script>
<?php endif; ?>
<?php endforeach; ?>
<?php foreach (glob("$glacierDir/include/head-*.php") ?: [] as $glacierHead): ?>
<?php try { include $glacierHead; } catch (Throwable $glacierError) { error_log('Glacier Theme: ' . basename($glacierHead) . ': ' . $glacierError->getMessage()); } ?>
<?php endforeach; ?>
<script defer src="<?php autov('/plugins/Glacier-Theme/scripts/glacier.js') ?>"></script>
<?php if (is_file("$glacierCustomDir/custom.css")): ?>
<style id="glacier-custom-css">
<?= str_ireplace('</style', '<\/style', file_get_contents("$glacierCustomDir/custom.css")) ?>

</style>
<?php endif; ?>
<?php if (is_file("$glacierCustomDir/custom.js")): ?>
<script id="glacier-custom-js">
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
<?= str_ireplace('</script', '<\/script', file_get_contents("$glacierCustomDir/custom.js")) ?>

});
</script>
<?php endif; ?>
<?php endif; ?>
GLACIER_THEME_EOF
cat > /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/GlacierThemeSettings.page <<'GLACIER_THEME_EOF'
Menu="Utilities"
Title="Glacier Theme"
Icon="paint-brush"
Tag="paint-brush"
---
<?php
$glacier = parse_plugin_cfg('Glacier-Theme');
$glacierAccent = preg_match('/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/', $glacier['accent'] ?? '') ? $glacier['accent'] : '#0f766e';
$glacierOnTopTheme = in_array($display['theme'] ?? '', ['white', 'black'], true);
?>
<p class="gl-version">_(Version)_ <strong>2026.10.26.1947</strong> &bull; <a href="https://github.com/R0m1k3/Glacier-Theme" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> &bull; <a href="https://github.com/R0m1k3/Glacier-Theme/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">_(Report an issue)_</a></p>
<?php if (!$glacierOnTopTheme): ?>
<p class="notice">_(Glacier is drawn over the Dynamix White and Black themes. Choose one of them in Settings > Display Settings to see it.)_</p>
<?php endif; ?>
<form markdown="1" method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
<input type="hidden" name="#file" value="Glacier-Theme/Glacier-Theme.cfg">

_(Theme)_:
: <select name="theme">
  <?=mk_option($glacier['theme'] ?? 'yes', "yes", _("Enabled"))?>
  <?=mk_option($glacier['theme'] ?? 'yes', "no", _("Disabled"))?>
  </select>

:glacier_theme_help:
> Applies Glacier's colours, font, menu, cards, buttons, tables and dialogs on every page while the
> Dynamix theme is **White** or **Black**. Add `?glacier=off` to any address to switch it off in one
> browser, `?glacier=on` to bring it back.
:end

_(Light or dark)_:
: <select name="mode">
  <?=mk_option($glacier['mode'] ?? 'auto', "auto", _("Follow the Dynamix theme"))?>
  <?=mk_option($glacier['mode'] ?? 'auto', "light", _("Always light"))?>
  <?=mk_option($glacier['mode'] ?? 'auto', "dark", _("Always dark"))?>
  </select>

:glacier_mode_help:
> **Follow the Dynamix theme**: light with White, dark with Black, so changing the theme in
> Display Settings changes both. The other two choices keep one
> mode whatever the Dynamix theme; Unraid's charts and pop-up panels keep the Dynamix colours.
:end

_(Accent colour)_:
: <input type="color" id="glacier-accent-pick" aria-label="_(Pick the accent colour)_" value="<?= htmlspecialchars($glacierAccent) ?>" style="width:4.4rem;height:3.6rem;padding:0.2rem;vertical-align:middle"> <input type="text" name="accent" id="glacier-accent" maxlength="7" class="narrow" placeholder="#0f766e" pattern="#?([0-9a-fA-F]{3}|[0-9a-fA-F]{6})" title="_(Colour code such as #0f766e; empty for the theme's teal)_" value="<?= htmlspecialchars($glacier['accent'] ?? '') ?>"> <input type="button" value="_(Default)_" onclick="glacierAccent('')">

:glacier_accent_help:
> The colour of highlights: submit buttons, links, switches, icons and bars. Leave it empty for
> Glacier's teal. The text on accent buttons switches between white and dark by itself.
:end

_(Dashboard greeting card)_:
: <select name="hero">
  <?=mk_option($glacier['hero'] ?? 'yes', "yes", _("Shown"))?>
  <?=mk_option($glacier['hero'] ?? 'yes', "no", _("Hidden"))?>
  </select>

:glacier_hero_help:
> A dark card above the Dashboard tiles with a greeting, the server name, the array status and
> the uptime.
:end

&nbsp;
: <input type="submit" value="_(Apply)_"><input type="button" value="_(Done)_" onclick="done()">

</form>

<script>
function glacierAccent(value) {
  document.getElementById('glacier-accent').value = value;
  if (value) document.getElementById('glacier-accent-pick').value = value;
  $('#glacier-accent').trigger('change');
}
document.getElementById('glacier-accent-pick').addEventListener('input', function () {
  glacierAccent(this.value);
});
</script>
GLACIER_THEME_EOF
cat > /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/default.cfg <<'GLACIER_THEME_EOF'
theme="yes"
mode="auto"
accent=""
hero="yes"
GLACIER_THEME_EOF
cat > /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/Glacier-Theme/fonts/plus-jakarta-sans-LICENSE.txt <<'GLACIER_THEME_EOF'
